I don't play Nethack in xterm, I play on console.
And I have got IBMgraphics working by commenting out the SYSFONT and
SYSFONTACM settings in /etc/sysconfig/i18n and setting LANG to something
without utf-8. (LANG=en_US works fine.)
Also, with kernel 2.6.17 and newer I need to run the unicode_stop script.
(I don't think the distribution matters, but I have Fedora 5 in one
machine and Fedora 6 in the other one.)

